117
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:26,260
I'll just enjoy a little shipping.

118
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,260
Really.

119
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,380
I have my own pace.

120
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:34,500
Get ready.

121
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,340
A bowl?

122
00:08:35,540 --> 00:08:37,420
Shippers feast. We don't suffer.

123
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:38,180
New ship evidence!

124
00:08:38,180 --> 00:08:40,036
When Yanzi lowers his right hand,
Yiliang's left arm moves.

125
00:08:40,060 --> 00:08:41,140
They may be holding hands!

126
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:43,140
Shipping and creating at once. Elite work!

127
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,420
Emergency! Emergency!

128
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,980
Yanzi's suit covered him up all day.

129
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:49,260
A collarbone bite by night!

130
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:49,780
Huh?

131
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:50,260
Really?

132
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:50,540
Huh?

133
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:51,300
Maybe Yanzi

134
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,740
just scratched himself by accident.

135
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:54,780
I've really been trying to hold back!

136
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:56,260
Even the gods can't convince me

137
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:58,900
that mosquito isn't called Gu Yiliang!

138
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,100
In 60 minutes,

139
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:03,820
27 instances of physical contact

140
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:05,540
and 163 exchanged glances.

141
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:08,900
The calculated probability that Niangzi is
real:

142
00:09:09,060 --> 00:09:11,020
99 percent.

143
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:12,140
So,

144
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:16,500
so,

145
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,020
Niangzi is real!

146
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:19,740
Niangzi is real now!

147
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:20,660
Niangzi is real!

148
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:22,060
Niangzi is real hot!

149
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:23,260
Niangzi is real!

150
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:24,820
Niangzi is real, right!

151
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:28,180
Sweetness every day, every year!

152
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:31,700
Sweetness every day, every year!

153
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,260
Dig in!

154
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:36,620
Serving up sweetness!

155
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:39,900
Gu Yiliang!

156
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:42,620
Real!

157
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:02,220
Douya,

158
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:03,420
help me record this.

159
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:05,900
Certainly.

160
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:18,580
I've become my rival's sugar daddy.

161
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:20,580
Can you teach me

162
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,660
how to keep someone?

163
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:27,020
Such arrangements violate public morals
and social norms.

164
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:28,780
If you need assistance,

165
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:31,740
I can suggest ways to improve your
personal charm

166
00:10:31,820 --> 00:10:33,380
and build healthy relationships.

167
00:10:57,180 --> 00:11:00,980
Green City's latest sugar-daddy anthology.

168
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:02,620
What's this?

169
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:14,060
Let's break up.

170
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:15,580
I won't break up with you.

171
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:18,060
I'm bankrupt.

172
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,580
Leave.

173
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:22,140
I can't support you anymore.

174
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:24,420
I'm not leaving.

175
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:27,180
I don't want your money.

176
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:28,540
I'll support you.

177
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:30,340
Let me be your sugar daddy, okay?

178
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:34,820
I'm very expensive to keep.

179
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,620
I know.

180
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:38,540
One hundred million,

181
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:40,140
one billion,

182
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:42,300
or ten billion,

183
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:44,020
you can have it all.

184
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:49,140
I knew you loved me.

185
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:51,620
I love you so much.

186
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:56,460
But why are we so far apart?

187
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:03,540
The website bans physical contact below
the neck.

188
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:07,820
What a tragic pair of lovers.

189
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:11,060
I was prejudiced.

190
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:15,220
I thought being kept was a terrible thing.

191
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:20,460
Such pure love can exist in this kind of
arrangement!

192
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:27,940
Flower Market's sugar-daddy anthology.

193
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:30,300
An advanced tutorial?

194
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:40,980
Say that again.

195
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:42,980
I said

196
00:12:43,300 --> 00:12:44,740
I'm ending our arrangement.

197
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:51,060
I can tolerate your little tantrums,

198
00:12:51,740 --> 00:12:53,780
but ending this on your own?

199
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:55,980
Impossible.

200
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,100
Gu Yiliang, don't forget,

201
00:12:58,260 --> 00:12:59,900
this is just a sugar-daddy arrangement.

202
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:01,820
Just an arrangement?

203
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,460
Hmph.

204
00:13:04,140 --> 00:13:06,060
Let go of me! What are you doing?

205
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:06,780
Let go!

206
00:13:06,780 --> 00:13:07,820
I'm your sugar daddy.

207
00:13:08,420 --> 00:13:09,540
You don't get to decide

208
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:10,620
what we are.

209
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:12,220
Let go of me!

210
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,460
Let go! This is...

211
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:17,940
A crime!

212
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,140
A crime!

213
00:13:24,380 --> 00:13:25,740
This is a crime!

214
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:30,780
This world is way too complicated.

215
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:32,500
I'm his sugar daddy.

216
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:34,420
I have an absolute duty to protect him.

217
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:38,260
Oh, come on.

218
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:42,380
Fiction exaggerates things.

219
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:44,820
This could never happen in real life...

220
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:43,300
That's enough.

221
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:45,860
We're in your office!

222
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:47,620
Wasn't this what you wanted?

223
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:49,460
I didn't want to die!

224
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:51,220
Are you trying to kill me?

225
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:53,060
We could try.

226
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,460
Mr. Gu.

227
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:01,940
Is Mr. Cheng in?

228
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:03,660
Yes, he is.

229
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:05,220
All right. I'll go see him myself.

230
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:11,980
Who is it?

231
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:13,420
Gu Yiliang.

232
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:19,820
Cheng, you dog! Are you crazy?

233
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,300
Let go of me!

234
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:27,020
Let go!

235
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:30,420
Boss, I was wrong.

236
00:15:30,660 --> 00:15:32,820
Please let me off this once.

237
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:45,460
What is it?

238
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:47,660
It's about my upcoming work schedule.

239
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:48,980
I'd like to discuss it.

240
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:51,740
Let's talk over there.

241
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:52,740
No need.

242
00:15:53,340 --> 00:15:54,420
I'll leave when I'm done.

243
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,220
Go ahead.

244
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:58,700
I'd like

245
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:02,020
some of my opportunities
redirected to Wei Yanzi's team.

246
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:05,660
Do you know what you're saying?

247
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:08,380
Wei Yanzi's acting needs work,

248
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:11,020
but his fashion presence and variety-show
skills

249
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:12,580
are the strongest among his peers.

250
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:16,740
He just needs more exposure and
opportunities.

251
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:20,380
You barely know him, don't you?

252
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:22,620
In what capacity are you helping him?

253
00:16:22,980 --> 00:16:24,060
I

254
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:27,060
should tell you.

255
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:30,140
I'm his sugar daddy now.

256
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:32,260
I'm just doing what I should.

257
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:35,420
Holy shit, that's huge gossip!

258
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:38,340
I know it's sudden,

259
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:39,860
but I've thought it through.

260
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:43,380
Redirecting opportunities doesn't mean
I'll slack off.

261
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:46,700
I just think some of my current
engagements

262
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:50,780
would work better with Wei Yanzi.

263
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:52,140
It's a win-win.

264
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:56,340
Does Wei Yanzi know

265
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:58,220
you're giving up these opportunities?

266
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:00,060
Not yet.

267
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:03,220
I'd like you to keep it secret for now.

268
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:07,380
Are you sure you shouldn't
discuss it with him?

269
00:17:17,460 --> 00:17:18,460
All right.

270
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:19,940
I'll agree.

271
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:23,500
You are Hengtu's cash cow, after all.

272
00:17:24,580 --> 00:17:27,060
Thanks. I'll leave you to it.

273
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:30,620
Wait.

274
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:33,180
Gu Yiliang,

275
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:35,900
as your and Wei Yanzi's boss,

276
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:39,420
I'm glad you're getting along.

277
00:17:39,820 --> 00:17:40,980
But as a friend,

278
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:43,700
I have to remind you of something.

279
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:48,700
There's no unbreakable
love in this industry.

280
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:53,100
And fanservice partners don't become real
couples overnight.

281
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:55,100
At least Gu Yiliang isn't stingy.

282
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:57,260
He's giving Wei Yanzi real, valuable
opportunities.

283
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:59,540
A hundred times better than Cheng the dog.

284
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:03,020
Thank you.

285
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:04,500
But I've made up my mind.

286
00:18:24,900 --> 00:18:26,020
Shit.

287
00:18:35,540 --> 00:18:37,100
I'm barely alive.

288
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:41,460
Two hours of charging, a full day of work.

289
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:44,700
Yanzi, you've got a few more engagements.

290
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:46,940
Your career is really taking off!

291
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:48,540
More?

292
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,860
The old man pulled strings again?

293
00:18:54,740 --> 00:18:55,380
Huh?

294
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:56,220
So tired.

295
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:56,740
Mr. Gu.

296
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:57,740
Haven't had breakfast?

297
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:01,020
Iced honey tea.

298
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:02,980
Drink it after you eat.

299
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:04,340
Have something first,

300
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:05,676
or you'll upset your stomach.

301
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,700
Oh.

302
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:12,180
Look!

303
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:13,820
Our fandom's finest creator,

304
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:16,020
feeding us first thing in the morning!

305
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,340
Eat first.

306
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:21,140
Okay.

307
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:24,140
It's not for us.

308
00:19:32,220 --> 00:19:34,100
Eat up. It's warm, not hot.

309
00:19:35,020 --> 00:19:36,356
You're being so thoughtful, Mr. Gu.

310
00:19:36,380 --> 00:19:38,100
Then let me return the favor. Here.

311
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:45,820
Here.

312
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,540
Here.

313
00:19:56,660 --> 00:19:57,660
Eat.

314
00:20:17,260 --> 00:20:18,260
Mr. Gu,

315
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:20,020
what does this mean?

316
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:43,380
Something about him feels different today.

317
00:20:43,460 --> 00:20:44,860
Every movement,

318
00:20:44,940 --> 00:20:47,900
every inch of him radiates boyfriend
energy.

319
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,780
Let's go to the set together.

320
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:53,540
I'll rehearse with you.

321
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:55,020
Let's get it in one take.

322
00:20:55,260 --> 00:20:56,260
Okay.

323
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:57,260
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

324
00:20:57,260 --> 00:20:58,260
Yeah.

325
00:20:59,060 --> 00:21:01,140
It's like watching fanfiction.

326
00:21:08,820 --> 00:21:11,380
What's fanfiction?

327
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:15,460
Fanfiction is fiction.

328
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:17,420
Yes. Novels. Just novels.

329
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:23,980
Do you read novels, Mr. Gu?

330
00:21:25,860 --> 00:21:26,860
No.

331
00:21:27,540 --> 00:21:28,340
I don't know much about them.

332
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:29,540
Neither do I.

333
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:45,980
We're here!

334
00:21:46,060 --> 00:21:47,060
We're really sorry.

335
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:48,860
Our last scene ran late.

336
00:21:48,860 --> 00:21:50,060
We came as soon as we wrapped.

337
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:51,340
I'm sorry.

338
00:21:51,420 --> 00:21:52,420
Sorry.

339
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:55,660
If filming's so important, skip the
magazine shoot.

340
00:21:57,140 --> 00:21:58,236
This is the only outfit left.

341
00:21:58,260 --> 00:21:59,500
Get changed and made up. Hurry.

342
00:22:00,060 --> 00:22:00,620
Oh.

343
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:01,700
Hurry up.

344
00:22:01,740 --> 00:22:02,740
Okay.

345
00:22:08,380 --> 00:22:09,660
This color

346
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:11,700
looks pretty good.

347
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:20,420
I look like a boss-babe saleswoman.

348
00:22:26,700 --> 00:22:27,740
Still not ready?

349
00:22:31,260 --> 00:22:34,140
Welcome to the Meiyan
Boss-Babe Business Club!

350
00:22:38,340 --> 00:22:39,716
Did you bring any of your own clothes?

351
00:22:39,740 --> 00:22:40,740
No.

352
00:22:40,820 --> 00:22:42,540
I rushed over. I didn't bring anything.

353
00:22:55,580 --> 00:22:56,580
The trousers are fine.

354
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:57,940
Wear this jacket.

355
00:22:58,380 --> 00:23:00,340
We're doing this as the "Lan Jue" leads.

356
00:23:00,460 --> 00:23:01,780
Matching styles will do.

357
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:02,980
Yeah.

358
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:07,140
That damn boyfriend energy.

359
00:23:07,260 --> 00:23:08,740
I couldn't impose.

360
00:23:18,500 --> 00:23:20,220
Your shoulders are a bit narrower than
mine.

361
00:23:20,420 --> 00:23:21,940
Just wear it oversized.

362
00:23:22,660 --> 00:23:24,140
For the photos, you can take it off

363
00:23:24,380 --> 00:23:25,380
over your shoulders.

364
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:34,420
What's wrong?

365
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:36,100
Nothing.

366
00:23:36,180 --> 00:23:38,420
Don't spare me just because I'm delicate.

367
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:40,660
Give me sweetness! Drown me in it!

368
00:23:41,180 --> 00:23:42,180
Thank you.

369
00:23:42,740 --> 00:23:44,060
You're welcome.

370
00:23:48,780 --> 00:23:49,860
Too loose.

371
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:52,220
Just right.

372
00:23:57,140 --> 00:23:59,380
Sorry. I overestimated myself.

373
00:23:59,460 --> 00:24:02,500
I can't handle sweetness on this scale!

374
00:24:05,020 --> 00:24:06,020
Great work, everyone.

375
00:24:06,020 --> 00:24:06,780
Thank you.

376
00:24:06,900 --> 00:24:07,900
Thanks, everyone.

377
00:24:08,860 --> 00:24:09,780
Take a short break over there.

378
00:24:09,860 --> 00:24:10,460
Okay.

379
00:24:10,540 --> 00:24:11,220
I'll check your photos.

380
00:24:11,260 --> 00:24:12,260
Okay.

381
00:24:17,860 --> 00:24:18,900
Mr. Gu.

382
00:24:18,940 --> 00:24:20,020
Mr. Wei.

383
00:24:25,220 --> 00:24:26,420
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

384
00:24:28,180 --> 00:24:29,540
No herbal tea,

385
00:24:29,620 --> 00:24:31,180
so have a drink to restore your health.

386
00:24:31,620 --> 00:24:32,700
Oh, right.

387
00:24:33,460 --> 00:24:35,540
Let me buy this ring from you.

388
00:24:35,740 --> 00:24:36,740
Why?

389
00:24:37,580 --> 00:24:39,140
I really like this brand,

390
00:24:39,580 --> 00:24:40,860
and I couldn't get this design.

391
00:24:40,900 --> 00:24:41,500
So, maybe...

392
00:24:41,540 --> 00:24:42,540
It's yours.

393
00:24:43,660 --> 00:24:44,660
It's yours.

394
00:24:44,780 --> 00:24:45,980
No, no!

395
00:24:46,060 --> 00:24:47,756
This ring costs tens of thousands. It's
expensive!

396
00:24:47,780 --> 00:24:48,980
I've never given you a gift.

397
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:50,660
I really shouldn't.

398
00:24:50,980 --> 00:24:51,980
Here, take it back.

399
00:25:09,700 --> 00:25:10,740
Mr. Gu,

400
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:13,460
am I a Christmas tree?

401
00:25:17,260 --> 00:25:18,900
What is all this?

402
00:25:19,060 --> 00:25:21,220
The Fall 2024 collection.

403
00:25:21,220 --> 00:25:23,220
No, I mean,

404
00:25:24,660 --> 00:25:25,700
what are you doing?

405
00:25:26,900 --> 00:25:28,340
You said you liked this brand.

406
00:25:28,780 --> 00:25:30,260
No, what I meant was...

407
00:25:30,340 --> 00:25:31,340
It's all yours.

408
00:25:31,460 --> 00:25:32,460
As long as you like it.

409
00:25:36,180 --> 00:25:39,340
He's definitely put a spell on me.

410
00:25:44,260 --> 00:25:45,340
No need, Mr. Gu.

411
00:25:45,940 --> 00:25:47,820
I'm grateful you lent me the ring and
clothes.

412
00:25:47,820 --> 00:25:48,860
Really grateful.

413
00:25:49,060 --> 00:25:50,340
You don't need to spend so much.

414
00:25:51,540 --> 00:25:52,700
Yanzi, you're up next.

415
00:25:52,740 --> 00:25:53,420
Get ready.

416
00:25:53,540 --> 00:25:55,660
Mr. Gu, I've got to go.

417
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:56,300
Oh, right.

418
00:25:56,340 --> 00:25:58,780
I'll buy this ring after all.

419
00:25:59,260 --> 00:26:00,700
It appeared on camera today.

420
00:26:00,740 --> 00:26:02,300
I'll have Xiao Chen pay your assistant.

421
00:26:02,660 --> 00:26:03,660
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

422
00:26:14,940 --> 00:26:17,060
Am I going about this the wrong way?

423
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:24,420
Herbal tea.

424
00:26:35,660 --> 00:26:37,340
I just need to treat you like a boyfriend.

425
00:26:37,540 --> 00:26:38,140
Okay.

426
00:26:38,260 --> 00:26:39,380
I'll pay his salary.

427
00:26:41,220 --> 00:26:42,340
Just right.

428
00:26:43,100 --> 00:26:44,700
Am I a Christmas tree?

429
00:26:44,860 --> 00:26:45,860
It's all yours.

430
00:26:46,060 --> 00:26:47,060
As long as you like it.

431
00:26:58,100 --> 00:26:59,100
Wait.

432
00:26:59,540 --> 00:27:00,540
What's wrong?

433
00:27:01,660 --> 00:27:02,340
Xiao Chen,

434
00:27:02,460 --> 00:27:04,380
are there any temples nearby?

435
00:27:05,420 --> 00:27:06,420
A temple?

436
00:27:06,580 --> 00:27:07,860
Actually, I think there is one.

437
00:27:08,060 --> 00:27:09,236
It's supposed to be quite powerful.

438
00:27:09,260 --> 00:27:10,260
Want your fortune told?

439
00:27:11,340 --> 00:27:13,260
I think

440
00:27:14,420 --> 00:27:15,700
I've been bewitched.

441
00:27:16,140 --> 00:27:16,660
I need to pray.

442
00:27:16,740 --> 00:27:18,300
Don't scare me!

443
00:27:18,620 --> 00:27:20,140
Who cursed you? A hater?

444
00:27:22,180 --> 00:27:23,540
Most likely,

445
00:27:24,580 --> 00:27:26,260
my own resolve wavered,

446
00:27:26,820 --> 00:27:28,940
and I did it to myself.

447
00:27:30,860 --> 00:27:31,860
Have some more.

448
00:27:33,020 --> 00:27:33,940
I'll drive you there.

449
00:27:33,980 --> 00:27:34,500
No need.

450
00:27:34,580 --> 00:27:35,980
Walking shows more devotion.

451
00:27:43,100 --> 00:27:44,100
Mr. Gu,

452
00:27:44,700 --> 00:27:46,140
why are you here alone?

453
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:47,300
Where's Mr. Wei?

454
00:27:48,540 --> 00:27:49,940
Yanzi left.

455
00:27:50,220 --> 00:27:52,020
He said he was tired after the shoot.

456
00:27:52,540 --> 00:27:53,540
Tired?

457
00:27:53,940 --> 00:27:55,300
Yeah. Worn out.

458
00:27:55,660 --> 00:27:58,620
He's tired of me already?

459
00:27:59,220 --> 00:28:00,980
What... what else did he say?

460
00:28:01,580 --> 00:28:04,179
He thinks someone's put...

461
00:28:05,940 --> 00:28:06,700
Put off?

462
00:28:06,940 --> 00:28:08,100
Something like that.

463
00:28:08,740 --> 00:28:09,740
Then he asked me

464
00:28:09,820 --> 00:28:11,140
if there were any temples nearby.

465
00:28:11,740 --> 00:28:12,860
He wanted to clear his head.

466
00:28:19,500 --> 00:28:21,980
Even as my sugar daddy, Gu Yiliang copies
novel characters.

467
00:28:22,100 --> 00:28:24,180
He's just going through the motions.

468
00:28:24,900 --> 00:28:26,140
All that sweet talk,

469
00:28:26,260 --> 00:28:28,660
but he's a jerk playing with my feelings.

470
00:28:28,740 --> 00:28:29,740
What a turnoff.

471
00:28:30,060 --> 00:28:32,260
Please sever the bond between us.

472
00:28:36,180 --> 00:28:37,220
Which temple did he go to?

473
00:28:37,380 --> 00:28:38,380
The one nearby.

474
00:28:40,260 --> 00:28:41,780
Xiao Zhang, you head back.

475
00:28:42,420 --> 00:28:44,580
Yiliang, should I drive you?

476
00:28:45,460 --> 00:28:47,980
Walking shows more devotion.

477
00:28:49,340 --> 00:28:50,420
Let's have dinner together.

478
00:28:54,780 --> 00:28:55,780
Which restaurant?

479
00:29:21,980 --> 00:29:23,980
Eating so much, kitty?

480
00:29:24,060 --> 00:29:26,580
Your tummy's all round.

481
00:29:26,780 --> 00:29:28,020
What an appetite.

482
00:29:28,580 --> 00:29:29,700
Such a good kitty.

483
00:29:47,540 --> 00:29:48,580
Gu Yiliang?

484
00:29:48,940 --> 00:29:49,940
What are you doing here?

485
00:29:50,740 --> 00:29:51,460
We're done filming.

486
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:53,020
Xiao Chen said you were here,

487
00:29:54,140 --> 00:29:55,180
so I came to see you.

488
00:30:00,660 --> 00:30:01,860
Is there something on my face?

489
00:30:06,260 --> 00:30:10,460
Are you... angry?

490
00:30:11,580 --> 00:30:12,820
Angry about what?

491
00:30:13,380 --> 00:30:14,620
What did Xiao Chen tell you?

492
00:30:14,900 --> 00:30:15,900
That I've become a monk?

493
00:30:19,380 --> 00:30:20,500
Did he really say that?

494
00:30:20,860 --> 00:30:22,540
Well, no.

495
00:30:23,140 --> 00:30:24,180
It's just...

496
00:30:27,100 --> 00:30:28,740
What suddenly made you come here?

497
00:30:29,180 --> 00:30:29,820
I...

498
00:30:30,140 --> 00:30:32,340
I can't say I came to a temple

499
00:30:32,420 --> 00:30:34,260
because my fanservice partner's been too
sweet,

500
00:30:34,300 --> 00:30:35,396
giving me an irregular heartbeat,

501
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:37,060
and I need to cleanse my worldly desires.

502
00:30:39,020 --> 00:30:40,740
Or that I'm here because

503
00:30:40,820 --> 00:30:42,436
my fanservice partner's smile is too
beautiful,

504
00:30:42,460 --> 00:30:44,220
and I'm afraid I'll lose control.

505
00:30:45,553 --> 00:30:47,033
And I definitely can't say...

506
00:30:47,940 --> 00:30:50,860
it's because I'm Beijing's Buddhist
prince.

507
00:30:52,420 --> 00:30:55,540
So that's your style.

508
00:30:56,900 --> 00:30:57,980
Oh, forget it.

509
00:30:58,060 --> 00:30:58,900
Since we're here,

510
00:30:59,020 --> 00:31:00,420
want to go inside and pray with me?

511
00:31:00,860 --> 00:31:01,460
Sure.

512
00:31:01,620 --> 00:31:02,620
Let's go.

513
00:31:02,900 --> 00:31:04,100
Eat up, kitty.

514
00:31:05,500 --> 00:31:06,500
Eat up.

515
00:31:24,540 --> 00:31:27,500
These offerings are a little strange.

516
00:31:34,060 --> 00:31:37,260
Is it really appropriate for us to pray
here?

517
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:43,386
[Guanyin, the Goddess of Mercy,
grants all requests for children.]

518
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,240
Bonus Content 4: Enjoying The Ship

519
00:31:50,866 --> 00:31:53,980
Gu Yiliang! What are you doing? Go!

520
00:31:55,500 --> 00:31:59,513
Niangzi is real!

521
00:33:14,060 --> 00:33:15,060
Watch out.

522
00:33:16,426 --> 00:33:19,086
But you don't have to study
them. You're fine the way you are.

523
00:33:21,526 --> 00:33:22,946
From now on, I'll get one for you.

524
00:33:24,306 --> 00:33:27,773
AI will only replace cream puffs like me.
A talented actor like you will keep going.

525
00:33:28,373 --> 00:33:29,766
You'll act into old age.
